  "title": "4 · Lock-Based Protocols & Deadlock (Unit 3)",
  "learn": "<h3>Locks</h3><p>A lock gives a transaction exclusive use of a data item. <b>Shared lock (S)</b>: read only. <b>Exclusive lock (X)</b>: read and write. <b>Compatibility</b>: S with S is allowed; S with X, X with S and X with X are not. Any number of transactions can hold S, but only one can hold X. <b>Upgrading</b> turns S into X; <b>downgrading</b> turns X into S.</p>\n<h3>Problem with simple locking</h3><p>A=1000, B=500. T1 locks A, subtracts 100, <b>unlocks A early</b>. T2 reads A=900 and B=500 (total 1400) before T1 adds 100 to B. The correct total is 1500, so the result is inconsistent.</p>\n<h3>Two-phase locking (2PL)</h3><p>All lock operations precede all unlock operations. <b>Growing phase</b>: acquire locks only. <b>Lock point</b>: the final lock. <b>Shrinking phase</b>: release only. 2PL guarantees serializability but may reduce concurrency (holding locks unnecessarily, locking too early) and can deadlock.</p>\n<h3>Variations</h3><p><b>Conservative (static) 2PL</b>: take all locks before starting, release after commit; <b>deadlock free</b>. <b>Strict 2PL</b>: X locks held until commit or abort; gives cascadeless schedules. <b>Rigorous 2PL</b>: all locks held until commit; avoids cascading rollback. Strict and rigorous can still deadlock.</p>\n<h3>Deadlock</h3><p>Two or more transactions each wait for a lock held by another. Detect it with a <b>wait-for graph</b>: node per transaction, edge Ti → Tj when Ti waits for an item held by Tj. <b>A cycle means deadlock.</b> Four necessary conditions: <b>mutual exclusion, hold and wait, no preemption, circular wait</b>.</p><h3>Why concurrency control?</h3><p><b>Purpose:</b> enforce isolation, preserve database consistency and resolve R-W, W-R and W-W conflicts so schedules are serializable. <b>Four techniques:</b> locking, timestamp-based, optimistic and multiversion. This lesson covers locking; the next covers timestamps.</p><figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 190 96\"><defs><marker id=\"ar\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"9\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"4.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path class=\"dg-arr\" d=\"M0,0L9,4.5L0,9z\"/></marker><marker id=\"ar2\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"9\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"4.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path class=\"dg-arr2\" d=\"M0,0L9,4.5L0,9z\"/></marker></defs><rect class=\"dg-hd\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"30.0\" y=\"20.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">held \\ asked</text><rect class=\"dg-hd\" x=\"60\" y=\"0\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"90.0\" y=\"20.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">S</text><rect class=\"dg-hd\" x=\"120\" y=\"0\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"150.0\" y=\"20.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">X</text><rect class=\"dg-hd\" x=\"0\" y=\"30\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"30.0\" y=\"50.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">S</text><rect class=\"dg-hd\" x=\"0\" y=\"60\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"30.0\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">X</text><rect class=\"dg-ok\" x=\"60\" y=\"30\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"90.0\" y=\"50.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✔ yes</text><rect class=\"dg-bad\" x=\"120\" y=\"30\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"150.0\" y=\"50.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✘ no</text><rect class=\"dg-bad\" x=\"60\" y=\"60\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"90.0\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✘ no</text><rect class=\"dg-bad\" x=\"120\" y=\"60\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"150.0\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✘ no</text></svg><figcaption class=\"mu\" style=\"text-align:center\">Figure 9: lock compatibility (rows = lock held, columns = lock requested)</figcaption></figure><figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 460 188\"><defs><marker id=\"ar\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"9\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"4.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path class=\"dg-arr\" d=\"M0,0L9,4.5L0,9z\"/></marker><marker id=\"ar2\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"9\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"4.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path class=\"dg-arr2\" d=\"M0,0L9,4.5L0,9z\"/></marker></defs><rect class=\"dg-hd\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"230\" height=\"26\"/><text class=\"dg-th\" x=\"115.0\" y=\"18.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T1</text><rect class=\"dg-hd\" x=\"230\" y=\"0\" width=\"230\" height=\"26\"/><text class=\"dg-th\" x=\"345.0\" y=\"18.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T2</text><rect class=\"dg-box\" x=\"2\" y=\"28\" width=\"226\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"115.0\" y=\"44.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lock-X(A); R(A); A = A − 100</text><rect class=\"dg-box\" x=\"2\" y=\"54\" width=\"226\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"115.0\" y=\"70.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W(A); Unlock(A)</text><rect class=\"dg-box\" x=\"232\" y=\"80\" width=\"226\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"345.0\" y=\"96.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lock-S(A); R(A) = 900; Unlock</text><rect class=\"dg-bad\" x=\"232\" y=\"106\" width=\"226\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"345.0\" y=\"122.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lock-S(B); R(B) = 500; Unlock</text><rect class=\"dg-box\" x=\"2\" y=\"132\" width=\"226\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"115.0\" y=\"148.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lock-X(B); B = B + 100; W(B)</text><rect class=\"dg-bad\" x=\"232\" y=\"158\" width=\"226\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"345.0\" y=\"174.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Display(A+B) = 1400 (should be 1500)</text></svg><figcaption class=\"mu\" style=\"text-align:center\">Figure 10: unlocking early breaks consistency (A = 1000, B = 500)</figcaption></figure><figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 185\"><defs><marker id=\"ar\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"9\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"4.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path class=\"dg-arr\" d=\"M0,0L9,4.5L0,9z\"/></marker><marker id=\"ar2\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"9\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"4.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path class=\"dg-arr2\" d=\"M0,0L9,4.5L0,9z\"/></marker></defs><path class=\"dg-ln\" d=\"M20,150 L160,40 L220,40 L360,150\"/><text class=\"dg-m\" x=\"90\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Growing phase</text><text class=\"dg-m\" x=\"190\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lock point</text><text class=\"dg-m\" x=\"300\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Shrinking phase</text><text class=\"dg-m\" x=\"90\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"middle\">acquire locks only</text><text class=\"dg-m\" x=\"300\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"middle\">release locks only</text><text class=\"dg-m\" x=\"190\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\">time →  (number of locks held ↑)</text></svg><figcaption class=\"mu\" style=\"text-align:center\">Figure 11: two-phase locking: all locks before the first unlock</figcaption></figure><figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 180\"><defs><marker id=\"ar\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"9\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"4.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path class=\"dg-arr\" d=\"M0,0L9,4.5L0,9z\"/></marker><marker id=\"ar2\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"9\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"4.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path class=\"dg-arr2\" d=\"M0,0L9,4.5L0,9z\"/></marker></defs><line class=\"dg-r\" x1=\"104.0\" y1=\"104.0\" x2=\"194.0\" y2=\"104.0\" marker-end=\"url(#ar2)\"/><line class=\"dg-r\" x1=\"196.0\" y1=\"76.0\" x2=\"106.0\" y2=\"76.0\" marker-end=\"url(#ar2)\"/><circle class=\"dg-box\" cx=\"80\" cy=\"90\" r=\"22\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"80\" y=\"95\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T1</text><circle class=\"dg-box\" cx=\"220\" cy=\"90\" r=\"22\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"220\" y=\"95\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T2</text></svg><figcaption class=\"mu\" style=\"text-align:center\">Figure 12: wait-for graph with a cycle = deadlock</figcaption></figure><figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg class=\"dg\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 180\"><defs><marker id=\"ar\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"9\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"4.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path class=\"dg-arr\" d=\"M0,0L9,4.5L0,9z\"/></marker><marker id=\"ar2\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"9\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"4.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path class=\"dg-arr2\" d=\"M0,0L9,4.5L0,9z\"/></marker></defs><line class=\"dg-r\" x1=\"93.76309626471988\" y1=\"120.33843390754302\" x2=\"135.08997904655345\" y2=\"61.300029933495054\" marker-end=\"url(#ar2)\"/><line class=\"dg-r\" x1=\"163.76309626471988\" y1=\"59.66156609245697\" x2=\"205.08997904655345\" y2=\"118.69997006650495\" marker-end=\"url(#ar2)\"/><line class=\"dg-r\" x1=\"196.0\" y1=\"140.0\" x2=\"106.0\" y2=\"140.0\" marker-end=\"url(#ar2)\"/><circle class=\"dg-box\" cx=\"80\" cy=\"140\" r=\"22\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"80\" y=\"145\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T1</text><circle class=\"dg-box\" cx=\"150\" cy=\"40\" r=\"22\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"150\" y=\"45\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T2</text><circle class=\"dg-box\" cx=\"220\" cy=\"140\" r=\"22\"/><text class=\"dg-t\" x=\"220\" y=\"145\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T3</text></svg><figcaption class=\"mu\" style=\"text-align:center\">Figure 13: a three-way deadlock</figcaption></figure>",
