  "lab": {
   "task": "T1 holds X(P) and waits for Q; T2 holds X(Q) and waits for P. Draw the wait-for graph and name the problem and one way to prevent it.",
   "solution": "Edges T1→T2 and T2→T1 form a cycle: deadlock. Prevent with conservative 2PL (lock everything first) or a global lock ordering (break circular wait)."
